<title>UK: NordLB sets 1.0 bln Czech crown two-year bond.</title>
<headline>NordLB sets 1.0 bln Czech crown two-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Creditanstalt Bankverein.</p>
<p> BORROWER   NORDDEUTSCHE LANDESBANK</p>
<p> AMT    1.0 BLN CZK   COUPON     10.85     MATURITY    15.NOV.98</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.08    PAY DATE    15.NOV.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.25	REOFFER*   99.95     YIELD	 10.88 PCT</p>
<p> NOTES	*RECOMMENDED REOFFER</p>
<p> MOODY	AA1	 LISTING    LONDON    PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  =	   DENOMS (K) 25-100    SALE LIMITS US/UK/DE</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  =	   TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.25	SELL CONC  1.0	 PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p> NOTES	ISSUED OFF THE EMTN PROGRAMME</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
